WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
Protesters are peaceful, but they have videographers

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:05.020
behind them, and then they start throwing down pepper balls

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:07.560
and tear gas to film it to try to create

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.600
the impression of chaos.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.480
Ah, yes.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.360
The Vietnam War would have gone so much better

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:17.120
if it wasn't for those stupid people filming it.

